Paper B public release folder, generated by tools/export_release_b.py.
An export replaces the exported files (listed with their sha256 in .elnino-release-manifest.json) and keeps .git.
It refuses, deleting nothing, while this folder holds any other file (for example DHS zips,
climate grids, an renv library or notes) or a changed exported file: keep reproduction
inputs and notes in a separate clone, not here.
